From cca95f22ea5b2ab546a84a72626781467f4b677c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:23:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nsiproxy.sys: Implement interface and route change
 notifications.

Bind network monitoring before accepting subscriptions. Handle silent route
removals, event loss and reader failures. Complete requests outside the
queue lock and arbitrate cancellation ownership.

Imported without changes from nanomatters/wine-salkim (Wineland), commit
cca95f22ea5b2ab546a84a72626781467f4b677c
https://github.com/nanomatters/wine-salkim/commit/cca95f22ea5b2ab546a84a72626781467f4b677c
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, the same as Wine. Author: Erhan Bilgili.
Wine bug: https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=60465
